  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT WILL SUPPORT THE PROCESS OF REESTRUCTURING THE PUBLIC ENTERPRISE THAT PROVIDES WATER AND SEWERAGE SERVICES WITHIN THE PROJECT AREA. THIS AREA INCLUDES THE URBAN CENTERS OF PANAMA, COLON, ARRAIJAN AND CHORRERA. THE PROJECT WILL REQUIRE, AMONG OTHERS, THE INVESTMENTS NECESSARY TO OPTIMIZE TECHNICAL, FINANCIAL AND OPERATIONAL FUNCTIONS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
